    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to bring number 2 Milesian Grove, Swords to the open market for sale. Beautifully presented throughout, this impressive 4 bed, 3 bath semi-detached home is ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac within the highly sought-after Milesian development. Overlooking a pleasant green space, the property has been tastefully upgraded and enjoys a private west-facing rear garden, offering a superb combination of stylish interiors, generous accommodation and excellent outdoor space.\n\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting entrance hallway, complete with useful under-stairs storage and an impressive guest WC. To the front of the property is a spacious and comfortable lounge, featuring a gas fireplace which flows seamlessly through to the west facing open-plan kitchen and dining area. The kitchen and dining space forms the heart of the home and has been thoughtfully designed to accommodate both everyday family life and entertaining. French doors open directly onto the sunny rear garden, creating a wonderful connection between the indoor and outdoor spaces while allowing an abundance of natural light to fill the room.\n\nUpstairs, the first floor offers four generously proportioned bedrooms, all accessed from a central landing. The stylish main bedroom benefits from fitted Sliderobes and a contemporary en-suite, complete with WC, wash hand basin and shower cubicle. Bedrooms two and three are both excellent-sized double bedrooms, while bedroom four offers a versatile space ideal as a single bedroom, home office or study. A beautifully upgraded family bathroom completes the accommodation and features a WC, wash hand basin, bath with electric shower.\n\nOutside, the property continues to impress. To the front, an exceptionally large fully paved driveway provides ample off-street parking for multiple vehicles. The private rear garden has been thoughtfully designed with low maintenance and practicality in mind, creating an ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining and relaxation. A charming pergola provides a cosy and inviting seating area, perfect for enjoying the garden throughout the year, while a substantial concrete-built shed offers excellent additional storage and is both wired and plumbed. The highly desirable west-facing aspect captures the afternoon and evening sunshine, making the garden an ideal retreat for family gatherings, entertaining guests or simply relaxing outdoors.\n\nMilesian is a highly regarded residential development in Swords, popular with families due to its peaceful setting, attractive surroundings and excellent convenience. The property is ideally positioned within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities, including an excellent selection of schools, shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities.\n\nSwords Village and Pavilions Shopping Centre are both within easy reach, offering an extensive choice of retail, dining and entertainment options. The area also benefits from excellent transport links, with Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 motorway network all readily accessible, making commuting to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas particularly convenient. Regular Dublin Bus and Swords Express services further enhance connectivity, while the nearby Airside Retail Park provides additional shopping, dining and leisure options.\n\n"
      },
      {
