        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.94m (6'4\") x 4.95m (16'3\")\n-LVP floor\n-Understairs storage \n-Guest WC \n-Panelling \n\n\nGuest WC - 0.73m (2'5\") x 1.53m (5'0\")\n-Tiled floor\n-WC & WHB \n-Vanity unit \n-Panelling\n\nLounge - 3.3m (10'10\") x 4.95m (16'3\")\n-LVP floor\n-Feature fireplace with gas insert \n-Built in storage \n-Coving\n\nKitchen/Diner - 5.71m (18'9\") x 3.86m (12'8\")\n-LVP floor\n-Fully fitted kitchen \n-Integrated appliances \n-French door to rear\n\nLanding\n-Carpet \n-Panelling \n-Hot press\n-Attic hatch\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.61m (8'7\") x 4.15m (13'7\")\n-SPC floor\n-Sliderobes \n-En-suite \n-Coving\n\nEn-Suite - 2.41m (7'11\") x 1.03m (3'5\")\n-Tiled floor\n-Partially tiled walls \n-WC & WHB \n-Vanity unit \n-Shower cubicle\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.04m (10'0\") x 3.75m (12'4\")\n-Carpet\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.59m (8'6\") x 2.56m (8'5\")\n-Laminate wood floor \n\n\nBedroom 4 - 1.03m (3'5\") x 2.35m (7'9\")\n-Laminated wood floor\n-Built in storage\n\nBathroom - 2.09m (6'10\") x 1.65m (5'5\")\n-Tiled floor\n-Partially tiled walls\n-WC & WHB \n-Vanity unit \n-Panel bath with electric shower\n\n"
